[{"answer":"I am curious about many things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/123-i-am-curious-2019-04-07-04-18-56/1.mp3"},{"answer":"I would like to find the answers to a lot of questions that I have.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/123-i-am-curious-2019-04-07-04-18-56/2.mp3"},{"answer":"What holds the stars up in the sky?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/123-i-am-curious-2019-04-07-04-18-56/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Why does ice form on the top of the lake when it is cold?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/123-i-am-curious-2019-04-07-04-18-56/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Is there life on other planets?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/123-i-am-curious-2019-04-07-04-18-56/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Why do we not fall off the face of the earth?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/123-i-am-curious-2019-04-07-04-18-56/6.mp3"},{"answer":"How do caterpillars turn into butterflies?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/123-i-am-curious-2019-04-07-04-18-56/7.mp3"},{"answer":"All of these things are mysteries to me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/123-i-am-curious-2019-04-07-04-18-56/8-2024-11-12-00-14-10.mp3"},{"answer":"There are so many questions that are unanswered.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/123-i-am-curious-2019-04-07-04-18-56/9.mp3"},{"answer":"I think I should go to the library and get a book to find out why people grow old.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/123-i-am-curious-2019-04-07-04-18-56/10.mp3"},{"answer":"What makes a television work?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/123-i-am-curious-2019-04-07-04-18-56/11.mp3"},{"answer":"I also want to know where electricity comes from.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/123-i-am-curious-2019-04-07-04-18-56/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Who is the strongest person in the world?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/123-i-am-curious-2019-04-07-04-18-56/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Who is the smartest person in the world?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/123-i-am-curious-2019-04-07-04-18-56/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Why do some people have blonde hair, and some people have black hair?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/123-i-am-curious-2019-04-07-04-18-56/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Why do people in different countries speak different languages?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/123-i-am-curious-2019-04-07-04-18-56/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Why do people have to die?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/123-i-am-curious-2019-04-07-04-18-56/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Why are no two snowflakes alike?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/123-i-am-curious-2019-04-07-04-18-56/18.mp3"},{"answer":"What makes people fall in love?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/123-i-am-curious-2019-04-07-04-18-56/19.mp3"},{"answer":"What makes the rivers run?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/123-i-am-curious-2019-04-07-04-18-56/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Why does the sun rise every morning?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/123-i-am-curious-2019-04-07-04-18-56/21.mp3"},{"answer":"How did the oceans form?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/123-i-am-curious-2019-04-07-04-18-56/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Why did the dinosaurs vanish from the earth?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/123-i-am-curious-2019-04-07-04-18-56/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I wonder if I'll ever find out the answers to all of my questions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/123-i-am-curious-2019-04-07-04-18-56/24.mp3"},{"answer":"I think I'll have to study hard and stay in school to find out everything that I want to know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/123-i-am-curious-2019-04-07-04-18-56/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Some questions never get answered.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/123-i-am-curious-2019-04-07-04-18-56/26.mp3"},{"answer":"It is good to be curious.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/123-i-am-curious-2019-04-07-04-18-56/27.mp3"},{"answer":"People who are curious about things are the ones who learn a lot,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/123-i-am-curious-2019-04-07-04-18-56/28.mp3"},{"answer":"and some curious people go on to invent things and make important discoveries.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/123-i-am-curious-2019-04-07-04-18-56/29.mp3"}]
